# Fitted model artifacts (.rds, .pkl, .nc, manifest.json, ...) can embed or
# describe real per-patient training data (see step1_risk_score/README.md
# and step2_cnma/README.md) and must never be committed. Only the exported
# coefficient/posterior JSON under src/lib/data/ is checked in.
#
# Extension-based backstop:
*.rds
*.RDS
*.pkl
*.nc
# Folder-based primary rule: anything dropped in a step's source/
# subfolder is ignored wholesale, regardless of file type — this is what
# actually matters for files like manifest.json that have no
# distinguishing extension of their own.
**/source/
